"""Learning and recognition permissions (docs/PLAN-LEARNING.md §8).

Three new codes: `learning.view` (training, quiz results and skills of the people one sees),
`learning.manage` (lessons, courses, quizzes and checks; assigning training) and
`recognition.manage` (hiding kudos, correcting points, the settings). Every role that manages
routines (`tasks.templates`, the managers) gains the two learning codes; nothing is removed and
no other role changes. `recognition.manage` stays with owners until they give it.
"""

